# Google account pool for the enter-v3-google farm.
# One account per line:  email|password   (also accepts email:password or email<TAB>password)
# Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Accounts already farmed are recorded in results/used_google.txt and skipped.
# Replace the sample below with real accounts (or point ENTER_GOOGLE_ACCOUNTS elsewhere).
#
# Example:
# user1@gmail.com|MyPassword123
# user2@yourdomain.com|AnotherPass456
